{"title":"Friday assorted links","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/911166983/0/marginalrevolution~Friday-assorted-links.html","date":1737129320000,"content":"<p>1. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.theguardian.com/lifeandstyle/2025/jan/09/the-sad-beige-aesthetic-why-has-the-world-suddenly-turned-taupe?CMP=oth_b-aplnews_d-1\" target=\"_blank\">The sad beige aesthetic</a>.</p>\r\n<p>2. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.nytimes.com/2025/01/15/technology/ai-chatgpt-boyfriend-companion.html\" target=\"_blank\">More on AI boyfriends and girlfriends</a> (NYT).</p>\r\n<p>3. “…free dog-sitting services now offered at major cultural landmarks, including Rome’s MAXXI Museum and Florence’s Uffizi, art lovers no longer have to choose between culture and their canine companions.” <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://news.artnet.com/art-world/italy-museums-dogsitting-2598288\" target=\"_blank\">TNSSJ</a>.</p>\r\n<p>4. “New randomized, controlled trial of students using GPT-4 as a tutor in Nigeria. 6 weeks of after-school AI tutoring = 2 years of typical learning gains, outperforming 80% of other educational interventions.” Link <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/emollick/status/1879633485004165375\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.</p>\r\n<p>5. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://andrewroberts.substack.com/p/the-great-economists-as-political\" target=\"_blank\">Andrew Roberts writes a very good review of GOAT</a>, focusing on the political dimension of each thinker.</p>\r\n<p>6. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://andrewroberts.substack.com/p/writing-good-non-fiction-books\" target=\"_blank\">Andrew Roberts analyzes my “best non-fiction” lists</a>.  I agree with his points.</p>\r\n<p>7. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.hyperdimensional.co/p/diffusion-confusion?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=2244049&amp;post_id=154912782&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=3o9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\">Dean Ball on AI export controls</a>.</p>\r\n<p>8. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.ft.com/content/3c99628a-7771-4a14-901c-4f466303e7fb\" target=\"_blank\">Belgian King as deus ex machina?</a> (FT)</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/01/friday-assorted-links-504.html\">Friday assorted links</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/911166983/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/911166983/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/911166983/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/911166983/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/911166983/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/911166983/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/01/friday-assorted-links-504.html#comments\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/comments20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/01/friday-assort